Package: ihsMW
Title: Access 'Malawi Integrated Household Survey' Data
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R: person("Vitumbiko", "Kayuni",
             email = "vitumbikokayuni@gmail.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-4331-3839"))
Description: Provides programmatic access to the 'Malawi Integrated Household
    Survey' ('IHS') via the 'World Bank Microdata Library' API
    <https://microdata.worldbank.org/api-documentation/>. Users can search
    variables, download data for 'IHS' rounds 2 through 5, and work with complex
    survey designs, with no manual file management required.
